Bundle-Name: Model Atlas Action API — stage lifecycle SPI
Bundle-Description: The whiteboard contracts an implementation registers to take part in \
 the stage lifecycle: StageActionService (called after an object entered, was updated in \
 or left a stage) and StageGate (asked before a transition or a delete, able to refuse it \
 and explaining itself with diagnostics). \
 Deliberately free of EMF and of the rest of the workflow bundle, so an \
 implementor outside this repository — or a bundle here that only reacts to stage \
 events — does not inherit the platform to provide one.

-workingset: workflow

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.util.promise;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.annotation.bundle;version=latest

-testpath: junit-jupiter-api
